%% title: Fee check outcomes
%% desc: An application with a fee waits in the fee queue. The clerk opens the proof, then marks the fee ok so the application can join a list, or sends it back with a reason.
flowchart LR
  A["Application with a fee"] --> Q["Fee check pending"]
  Q --> O["Open the proof<br/>amount, method, reference"]
  O -->|"Fee is ok"| OK["Fee ok<br/>can join a list"]:::done
  O -->|"Send back + reason"| SB["Fee sent back"]:::stop
  classDef done fill:#ebfbee,stroke:#2b8a3e,color:#14411d
  classDef stop fill:#fff5f5,stroke:#c92a2a,color:#5c1111
